<title>UK: L-Bank sets A$100 million three-year bond.</title>
<headline>L-Bank sets A$100 million three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager BZW.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LANDESKREDITBANK BADEN-WUERTTEMBERG</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  THE STATE DEVELOPMENT AGENCY OF BADEN-WUERTTEMBERG  AMT    A$100 MLN     COUPON     7.0 PCT   MATURITY    30.MAY.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.325   PAY DATE    30.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.50	LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 1-10	SALE LIMITS US/UK/GE</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  1.0	 PRAECIPUUM  0.125</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
